<title>POLAND: DROSED 96 NET FALLS TO PLN 2.7 MLN.</title>
<headline>DROSED 96 NET FALLS TO PLN 2.7 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net loss		 2.17 vs   0.20 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   0.92 vs   0.39 profit</p>
<p> Operating loss	 1.19 vs   0.34 profit</p>
<p> Sales		   11.31 vs   7.17</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.56 vs   6.16</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 5.67 vs   8.58</p>
<p> Operating profit     5.93 vs   7.61</p>
<p> Sales		  141.28 vs  91.65</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish poultry producer is Drosed SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
